Command:
python scripts/test_search_result_quality_audit.py

Result:
ModuleNotFoundError: No module named 'magnet'

Root cause:
The test added only ROOT/scripts to sys.path before importing magnet.health_check. The project root itself was not on sys.path.

Impact:
Test harness import failure only; no production code or source data was executed or changed.

Fix:
Add ROOT to sys.path before importing the magnet package, then rerun the full audit suite.
